 <sys:String x:Key="UpdateHelp">Downloads from the official GitHub repository and verifies SHA256 before installing. Close all VMs before installation. The manager will restart. Portable copies install into the per-user Weims Manager folder; VM disks and runtime paths are preserved.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="UpdateCurrentNotes" xml:space="preserve">Preview 1.1.0-pre.2

• Check GitHub for compatible stable or preview releases.
• Read release notes before downloading and updating.
• Verify SHA256 before installation; postpone installation while VMs or other Manager windows are open.
• Switch between English and Chinese immediately, without restarting or losing the current page and configuration.
• Display the actual application version.

Known limitation: VM freezes may still occur, including during resizing. This remains under investigation.

A real in-place installation upgrade has not been validated.</sys:String>
